    <string name="au22_stremio_account_intro">Sign in with your Stremio account to keep your add-ons, library and continue watching in step with it. Your password is sent only to Stremio (api.strem.io) and is not stored. This uses Stremio\'s account service, which Stremio can change or block at any time. Telos is not affiliated with Stremio.</string>
